"avg_logprob": -0.10796994481767927, "compression_ratio": 1.6199376947040498, "no_speech_prob": 0.055264659225940704}, {"id": 36, "seek": 11040, "start": 110.4, "end": 112.2, "text": " well, I'm down to practically nothing.", "tokens": [50363, 880, 11, 314, 1101, 866, 284, 14547, 2147, 13, 50453], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 37, "seek": 11040, "start": 112.2, "end": 114.72, "text": " So why does beef, and lamb too for that matter,", "tokens": [50453, 1406, 1521, 857, 12023, 11, 290, 19343, 1165, 329, 326, 2300, 11, 50579], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 38, "seek": 11040, "start": 114.72, "end": 117.72, "text": " pack such a powerful punch to the planet?", "tokens": [50579, 2353, 884, 257, 3665, 10862, 284, 262, 5440, 30, 50729], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 39, "seek": 11040, "start": 117.72, "end": 123.04, "text": " Livestock accounts for a little over 14% of global greenhouse gas emissions.", "tokens": [50729, 32020, 395, 735, 5504, 329, 257, 1310, 625, 1478, 4, 286, 3298, 16325, 3623, 8971, 13, 50995], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 40, "seek": 11040, "start": 123.04, "end": 124.64, "text": " If that sort of seems low to you,", "tokens": [50995, 1002, 326, 3297, 286, 2331, 1877, 284, 345, 11, 51075], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 41, "seek": 11040, "start": 124.64, "end": 127.64000000000001, "text": " consider it's about equal to transportation.", "tokens": [51075, 2074, 340, 338, 546, 4961, 284, 9358, 13, 51225], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 42, "seek": 11040, "start": 127.64000000000001, "end": 131.16, "text": " We're talking all the cars, trucks, planes, trains,", "tokens": [51225, 775, 821, 3375, 477, 262, 5006, 11, 13960, 11, 13016, 11, 13404, 11, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 43, "seek": 11040, "start": 131.16, "end": 133.56, "text": " and ships on the planet combined.", "tokens": [51401, 290, 7937, 319, 262, 5440, 5929, 13, 51521], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 44, "seek": 11040, "start": 133.56, "end": 137.44, "text": " This is partly because ruminant animals like cows and sheep,", "tokens": [51521, 770, 318, 11476, 780, 374, 7230, 415, 4695, 588, 22575, 290, 15900, 11, 51715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 45, "seek": 11040, "start": 137.44, "end": 138.64000000000001, "text": " they're just gassy.", "tokens": [51715, 484, 821, 655, 308, 11720, 13, 51775], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14942618339292466, "compression_ratio": 1.5498281786941581, "no_speech_prob": 0.002981708385050297}, {"id": 46, "seek": 13864, "start": 139.64, "end": 145.32, "text": " And the methane they produce is at least 25 times more potent than carbon dioxide.", "tokens": [50413, 843, 262, 25006, 484, 4439, 318, 379, 1551, 1679, 1661, 517, 16739, 621, 6588, 17556, 13, 50697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13147256992481374, "compression_ratio": 1.6015037593984962, "no_speech_prob": 0.014054279774427414}, {"id": 47, "seek": 13864, "start": 145.32, "end": 147.83999999999997, "text": " Plus, it takes a lot of land, fertilizer,", "tokens": [50697, 8227, 11, 340, 2753, 257, 1256, 286, 1956, 11, 37113, 11, 50823], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13147256992481374, "compression_ratio": 1.6015037593984962, "no_speech_prob": 0.014054279774427414}, {"id": 48, "seek": 13864, "start": 147.83999999999997, "end": 152.16, "text": " and about a billion tons of grain to feed all that livestock.", "tokens": [50823, 290, 546, 257, 2997, 10860, 286, 13020, 284, 3745, 477, 326, 24424, 13, 51039], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13147256992481374, "compression_ratio": 1.6015037593984962, "no_speech_prob": 0.014054279774427414}, {"id": 49, "seek": 13864, "start": 152.16, "end": 155.92, "text": " And you could feed 3.5 billion people with that grain.", "tokens": [51039, 843, 345, 714, 3745, 513, 13, 20, 2997, 661, 351, 326, 13020, 13, 51227], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13147256992481374, "compression_ratio": 1.6015037593984962, "no_speech_prob": 0.014054279774427414}, {"id": 50, "seek": 13864, "start": 155.92, "end": 158.64, "text": " If we were just directly eating these grains ourselves,", "tokens": [51227, 1002, 356, 547, 655, 3264, 6600, 777, 21824, 6731, 11, 51363], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13147256992481374, "compression_ratio": 1.6015037593984962, "no_speech_prob": 0.014054279774427414}, {"id": 51, "seek": 13864, "start": 158.64, "end": 162.67999999999998, "text": " it would eliminate a lot of the CO2 that's emitted from cattle production.", "tokens": [51363, 340, 561, 11005, 257, 1256, 286, 262, 7375, 17, 326, 338, 31234, 422, 17025, 3227, 13, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13147256992481374, "compression_ratio": 1.6015037593984962, "no_speech_prob": 0.014054279774427414}, {"id": 52, "seek": 13864, "start": 162.67999999999998, "end": 165.16, "text": " So it's clear that meat has a pretty big carbon load,", "tokens": [51565, 1406, 340, 338, 1598, 326, 6174, 468, 257, 2495, 1263, 6588, 3440, 11, 51689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13147256992481374, "compression_ratio": 1.6015037593984962, "no_speech_prob": 0.014054279774427414}, {"id": 53, "seek": 16516, "start": 165.28, "end": 169.68, "text": " but it's also worth remembering that not all livestock is raised equally.", "tokens": [50369, 475, 340, 338, 635, 2861, 24865, 326, 407, 477, 24424, 318, 4376, 8603, 13, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 54, "seek": 16516, "start": 169.68, "end": 171.72, "text": " In parts of the American West, for instance,", "tokens": [50589, 554, 3354, 286, 262, 1605, 2688, 11, 329, 4554, 11, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 55, "seek": 16516, "start": 171.72, "end": 176.68, "text": " ranchers are working to raise livestock in ways that actually help restore the land.", "tokens": [50691, 32205, 7084, 389, 1762, 284, 5298, 24424, 287, 2842, 326, 1682, 1037, 11169, 262, 1956, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 56, "seek": 16516, "start": 176.68, "end": 180.4, "text": " And they're experimenting with ways that soil and grasslands", "tokens": [50939, 843, 484, 821, 27826, 351, 2842, 326, 9260, 290, 8701, 4447, 51125], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 57, "seek": 16516, "start": 180.4, "end": 183.44, "text": " can be used to keep carbon pollution out of the air.", "tokens": [51125, 460, 307, 973, 284, 1394, 6588, 12231, 503, 286, 262, 1633, 13, 51277], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 58, "seek": 16516, "start": 183.44, "end": 186.44, "text": " But even these sustainable ranchers will really tell you,", "tokens": [51277, 887, 772, 777, 13347, 32205, 7084, 481, 1107, 1560, 345, 11, 51427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 59, "seek": 16516, "start": 186.44, "end": 188.6, "text": " we're probably eating too much meat.", "tokens": [51427, 356, 821, 2192, 6600, 1165, 881, 6174, 13, 51535], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 60, "seek": 16516, "start": 188.6, "end": 192.2, "text": " I know a lot of people who, if you don't serve them meat for lunch or dinner,", "tokens": [51535, 314, 760, 257, 1256, 286, 661, 508, 11, 611, 345, 836, 470, 4691, 606, 6174, 329, 9965, 393, 8073, 11, 51715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 61, "seek": 16516, "start": 192.2, "end": 194.32, "text": " they're kind of like, well, when is the meat coming out?", "tokens": [51715, 484, 821, 1611, 286, 588, 11, 880, 11, 618, 318, 262, 6174, 2406, 503, 30, 51821], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10408818460729001, "compression_ratio": 1.725552050473186, "no_speech_prob": 0.08941294252872467}, {"id": 62, "seek": 19432, "start": 194.32, "end": 197.56, "text": " It's to the point now where the US actually has one of the highest", "tokens": [50363, 632, 338, 284, 262, 966, 783, 810, 262, 1294, 1682, 468, 530, 286, 262, 4511, 50525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 63, "seek": 19432, "start": 197.56, "end": 199.07999999999998, "text": " meat footprints per capita.", "tokens": [50525, 6174, 48012, 583, 21344, 13, 50601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 64, "seek": 19432, "start": 199.07999999999998, "end": 201.51999999999998, "text": " So what about not eating meat at all?", "tokens": [50601, 1406, 644, 546, 407, 6600, 6174, 379, 477, 30, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 65, "seek": 19432, "start": 201.51999999999998, "end": 204.35999999999999, "text": " Vegan is the way to go for the least impact on the planet.", "tokens": [50723, 34829, 318, 262, 835, 284, 467, 329, 262, 1551, 2928, 319, 262, 5440, 13, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 66, "seek": 19432, "start": 204.35999999999999, "end": 208.88, "text": " But it's not that much different in terms of emissions than, say, a vegetarian diet.", "tokens": [50865, 887, 340, 338, 407, 326, 881, 1180, 287, 2846, 286, 8971, 621, 11, 910, 11, 257, 24053, 5496, 13, 51091], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 67, "seek": 19432, "start": 208.88, "end": 212.68, "text": " And the team found that the environmental impact of the Mediterranean diet", "tokens": [51091, 843, 262, 1074, 1043, 326, 262, 6142, 2928, 286, 262, 19517, 5496, 51281], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 68, "seek": 19432, "start": 212.68, "end": 216.12, "text": " is pretty similar to vegan and vegetarian diets.", "tokens": [51281, 318, 2495, 2092, 284, 15169, 290, 24053, 18977, 13, 51453], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 69, "seek": 19432, "start": 216.12, "end": 219.24, "text": " It's a lot less meat heavy than what Americans are used to.", "tokens": [51453, 632, 338, 257, 1256, 1342, 6174, 4334, 621, 644, 3399, 389, 973, 284, 13, 51609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 70, "seek": 19432, "start": 219.24, "end": 222.2, "text": " So fish and poultry a few times a week,", "tokens": [51609, 1406, 5916, 290, 34101, 257, 1178, 1661, 257, 1285, 11, 51757], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11078250314307025, "compression_ratio": 1.6891891891891893, "no_speech_prob": 0.009067264385521412}, {"id": 71, "seek": 22220, "start": 222.2, "end": 225.76, "text": " beef maybe once a month, plenty of plant-based foods,", "tokens": [50363, 12023, 3863, 1752, 257, 1227, 11, 6088, 286, 4618, 12, 3106, 9013, 11, 50541], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 72, "seek": 22220, "start": 225.76, "end": 227.6, "text": " and of course, loads of olive oil.", "tokens": [50541, 290, 286, 1781, 11, 15989, 286, 19450, 3056, 13, 50633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 73, "seek": 22220, "start": 227.6, "end": 230.28, "text": " Eliminating, like, 90% of your meat intake", "tokens": [50633, 27405, 6010, 11, 588, 11, 4101, 4, 286, 534, 6174, 10337, 50767], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 74, "seek": 22220, "start": 230.28, "end": 233.11999999999998, "text": " is more important than eliminating all of your meat.", "tokens": [50767, 318, 517, 1593, 621, 18591, 477, 286, 534, 6174, 13, 50909], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 75, "seek": 22220, "start": 233.11999999999998, "end": 234.32, "text": " We don't all have to be vegan.", "tokens": [50909, 775, 836, 470, 477, 423, 284, 307, 15169, 13, 50969], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 76, "seek": 22220, "start": 234.32, "end": 236.2, "text": " We don't all even have to be vegetarian.", "tokens": [50969, 775, 836, 470, 477, 772, 423, 284, 307, 24053, 13, 51063], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 77, "seek": 22220, "start": 236.2, "end": 238.95999999999998, "text": " If we can just reduce our meat intake, every little bit helps.", "tokens": [51063, 1002, 356, 460, 655, 4646, 674, 6174, 10337, 11, 790, 1310, 1643, 5419, 13, 51201], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 78, "seek": 22220, "start": 238.95999999999998, "end": 241.83999999999997, "text": " And if you can bring it down a lot, you can help the climate a lot.", "tokens": [51201, 843, 611, 345, 460, 2222, 340, 866, 257, 1256, 11, 345, 460, 1037, 262, 4258, 257, 1256, 13, 51345], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 79, "seek": 22220, "start": 241.83999999999997, "end": 244.67999999999998, "text": " If we all just switched to a Mediterranean diet,", "tokens": [51345, 1002, 356, 477, 655, 15293, 284, 257, 19517, 5496, 11, 51487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 80, "seek": 22220, "start": 244.67999999999998, "end": 249.44, "text": " it could actually solve 15% of global warming pollution by 2050.", "tokens": [51487, 340, 714, 1682, 8494, 1315, 4, 286, 3298, 9917, 12231, 416, 32215, 13, 51725], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11251147016346884, "compression_ratio": 1.7098976109215016, "no_speech_prob": 0.08013581484556198}, {"id": 81, "seek": 24944, "start": 249.44, "end": 251.44, "text": " If everyone were to move toward it,", "tokens": [50363, 1002, 2506, 547, 284, 1445, 3812, 340, 11, 50463], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 82, "seek": 24944, "start": 251.44, "end": 255.6, "text": " that is equivalent to taking somewhere around a billion cars off of the streets", "tokens": [50463, 326, 318, 7548, 284, 2263, 7382, 1088, 257, 2997, 5006, 572, 286, 262, 6483, 50671], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 83, "seek": 24944, "start": 255.6, "end": 257.44, "text": " in terms of vehicle emissions each year.", "tokens": [50671, 287, 2846, 286, 4038, 8971, 1123, 614, 13, 50763], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 84, "seek": 24944, "start": 257.44, "end": 259.88, "text": " So that kind of a footprint is big time.", "tokens": [50763, 1406, 326, 1611, 286, 257, 24713, 318, 1263, 640, 13, 50885], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 85, "seek": 24944, "start": 259.88, "end": 263.76, "text": " But say you still want more meat than the Mediterranean diet recommends.", "tokens": [50885, 887, 910, 345, 991, 765, 517, 6174, 621, 262, 19517, 5496, 20829, 13, 51079], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 86, "seek": 24944, "start": 263.76, "end": 268.32, "text": " Just cutting down your portion size to the doctor-recommended four ounces", "tokens": [51079, 2329, 7720, 866, 534, 6903, 2546, 284, 262, 6253, 12, 47335, 1631, 1440, 24405, 51307], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 87, "seek": 24944, "start": 268.32, "end": 270.84, "text": " can reduce your emissions by half.", "tokens": [51307, 460, 4646, 534, 8971, 416, 2063, 13, 51433], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 88, "seek": 24944, "start": 270.84, "end": 271.64, "text": " That's huge.", "tokens": [51433, 1320, 338, 3236, 13, 51473], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 89, "seek": 24944, "start": 271.64, "end": 275.2, "text": " In fact, the doctors are telling us we're eating about twice as much meat", "tokens": [51473, 554, 1109, 11, 262, 7519, 389, 5149, 514, 356, 821, 6600, 546, 5403, 355, 881, 6174, 51651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 90, "seek": 24944, "start": 275.2, "end": 277.32, "text": " as we really need for a healthy diet.", "tokens": [51651, 355, 356, 1107, 761, 329, 257, 5448, 5496, 13, 51757], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1088924331665039, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 0.041809920221567154}, {"id": 91, "seek": 27732, "start": 277.32, "end": 280.08, "text": " The good news is we are listening to our doctors.", "tokens": [50363, 383, 922, 1705, 318, 356, 389, 8680, 284, 674, 7519, 13, 50501], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 92, "seek": 27732, "start": 280.08, "end": 284.52, "text": " In the last decade, there's been a 19% drop in the amount of beef we eat.", "tokens": [50501, 554, 262, 938, 5707, 11, 612, 338, 587, 257, 678, 4, 4268, 287, 262, 2033, 286, 12023, 356, 4483, 13, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 93, "seek": 27732, "start": 284.52, "end": 287.2, "text": " All these things that you're already being told are good for you", "tokens": [50723, 1439, 777, 1243, 326, 345, 821, 1541, 852, 1297, 389, 922, 329, 345, 50857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 94, "seek": 27732, "start": 287.2, "end": 289.2, "text": " also happen to be good for the planet.", "tokens": [50857, 635, 1645, 284, 307, 922, 329, 262, 5440, 13, 50957], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 95, "seek": 27732, "start": 289.2, "end": 292.92, "text": " So what we eat really is a big part of the climate puzzle.", "tokens": [50957, 1406, 644, 356, 4483, 1107, 318, 257, 1263, 636, 286, 262, 4258, 15027, 13, 51143], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 96, "seek": 27732, "start": 292.92, "end": 295.92, "text": " I mean, we may not all be able to afford an electric car", "tokens": [51143, 314, 1612, 11, 356, 743, 407, 477, 307, 1498, 284, 5368, 281, 5186, 1097, 51293], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 97, "seek": 27732, "start": 295.92, "end": 298.2, "text": " or putting solar panels on our house,", "tokens": [51293, 393, 5137, 6591, 13043, 319, 674, 2156, 11, 51407], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 98, "seek": 27732, "start": 298.2, "end": 300.12, "text": " but we all have to eat every day.", "tokens": [51407, 475, 356, 477, 423, 284, 4483, 790, 1110, 13, 51503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 99, "seek": 27732, "start": 300.12, "end": 303.28, "text": " And these choices we make can add up to really big numbers.", "tokens": [51503, 843, 777, 7747, 356, 787, 460, 751, 510, 284, 1107, 1263, 3146, 13, 51661], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 100, "seek": 27732, "start": 303.28, "end": 305.96, "text": " And since meat has a pretty big carbon load,", "tokens": [51661, 843, 1201, 6174, 468, 257, 2495, 1263, 6588, 3440, 11, 51795], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08716050394765147, "compression_ratio": 1.6828478964401294, "no_speech_prob": 0.007466599345207214}, {"id": 101, "seek": 30596, "start": 305.96, "end": 308.59999999999997, "text": " we need to be thoughtful about how much we eat.", "tokens": [50363, 356, 761, 284, 307, 22677, 546, 703, 881, 356, 4483, 13, 50495], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13570358092526355, "compression_ratio": 1.5076142131979695, "no_speech_prob": 0.008322550915181637}, {"id": 102, "seek": 30596, "start": 308.59999999999997, "end": 311.0, "text": " As for that ribeye steak that I really love,", "tokens": [50495, 1081, 329, 326, 12183, 25379, 26320, 326, 314, 1107, 1842, 11, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13570358092526355, "compression_ratio": 1.5076142131979695, "no_speech_prob": 0.008322550915181637}, {"id": 103, "seek": 30596, "start": 311.0, "end": 313.59999999999997, "text": " I am honestly trying to cut back.", "tokens": [50615, 314, 716, 12698, 2111, 284, 2005, 736, 13, 50745], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13570358092526355, "compression_ratio": 1.5076142131979695, "no_speech_prob": 0.008322550915181637}, {"id": 104, "seek": 30596, "start": 313.59999999999997, "end": 315.84, "text": " Maybe it's just a smaller piece of steak", "tokens": [50745, 6674, 340, 338, 655, 257, 4833, 3704, 286, 26320, 50857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13570358092526355, "compression_ratio": 1.5076142131979695, "no_speech_prob": 0.008322550915181637}, {"id": 105, "seek": 30596, "start": 315.84, "end": 319.35999999999996, "text": " or simply swapping out a meat dish for a veggie burger.", "tokens": [50857, 393, 2391, 38869, 503, 257, 6174, 9433, 329, 257, 1569, 23571, 26593, 13, 51033], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13570358092526355, "compression_ratio": 1.5076142131979695, "no_speech_prob": 0.008322550915181637}, {"id": 106, "seek": 30596, "start": 319.35999999999996, "end": 323.15999999999997, "text": " It may seem like a small thing, but it really does add up to big impacts.", "tokens": [51033, 632, 743, 1283, 588, 257, 1402, 1517, 11, 475, 340, 1107, 857, 751, 510, 284, 1263, 12751, 13, 51223], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13570358092526355, "compression_ratio": 1.5076142131979695, "no_speech_prob": 0.008322550915181637}], "language": "English"}